# SDDRA Work Plan

Purpose:
  Phase-based work plan for SDDRA system development.
  Each phase has clear goals, tasks, and deliverables.
  Track progress by phase and task.

Owns: WORK-PLAN.sdd

## Phase 1: Foundation & Structure (COMPLETED)

Status: Completed

Goals:
  Establish core system structure and immutable rules

Deliverables:
  - .sdd/ system with immutable files
  - Chain graph (D0 with 6 arms)
  - Protocol/ROOT.sdd (universal rules)
  - PROJECT.sdd (root router)
  - INDEX.sdd (routing table)
  - Templates system (.sdd/templates/)
  - Decision ledger engine
  - Task lifecycle engine

Key Decisions:
  - Two-language model (.sdd/ vs project/)
  - Immutability of .sdd/ files
  - Human gates at every stage
  - Token economy and budgets

Files Created: 300+

