## Phase 161 — Pyramid Agent Orchestration

Status: Implemented — pending human commit and DEC approval

Goals:
  Extend SW1 chain with dual dispatch channels, sub-agent lifecycle (spawn/notify/cleanup), RECONCILE gate, CloseLadder (MU→TASK→DEC), .specdd/ gitignore, tests, and governance records.

Deliverables:
  - `.sdd/workflow/dispatch-channels.sdd` — dual channels (R/F), within-stage scope, routing rules [DC1]-[DC4]
  - `.sdd/agent/subagent-lifecycle.sdd` — levels L0/L1/L2, depth cap 2, self-delegation, typed outcomes, runtime folders, cleanup, reconciliation
  - SW1 extensions in `.sdd/chains/swarm.sdd` — RECONCILE step, CloseLadder (MU/TASK/DEC), rules [SW1-9]-[SW1-14], StepState updates
  - Micro-unit updates — `.sdd/workflow/micro-unit.sdd` (channel, parent/children/folder, [MU-7]-[MU-9]); `.sdd/schemas/micro-unit.sdd` (fields + [MS9]-[MS11])
  - Supervisor updates — `.sdd/agent/supervisor.sdd` ([SUP-06],[SUP-07])
  - Command updates — `.sdd/commands/sdd-swarm.sdd` (RECONCILE, initial load, rule refs)
  - INDEX updates — `.sdd/workflow/INDEX.sdd`, `.sdd/agent/INDEX.sdd`, `.sdd/INDEX.sdd`
  - `.gitignore` — add runtime/local-only roots (.specdd/, .sdd/codding/, .sdd/projects/sddra/history/, docs/assets/)
  - `sdd-adapter/__tests__/pyramid-orchestration.test.ts` + register in `sdd-adapter/__tests__/run.ts`
  - DEC-2026-1011-002 (`.sdd/projects/sddra/decisions/2026-1011-002-pyramid-agent-orchestration.md`)

Tasks:
  [x] T1 — `.sdd/workflow/dispatch-channels.sdd` (new spec, [DC1]-[DC4])
  [x] T2 — `.sdd/agent/subagent-lifecycle.sdd` (new spec, [SAL1]-[SAL8])
  [x] T3 — `.sdd/chains/swarm.sdd` (RECONCILE, CloseLadder, [SW1-9]-[SW1-14], StepState)
  [x] T4 — `.sdd/workflow/micro-unit.sdd` (channel, lineage + folder, [MU-7]-[MU-9])
  [x] T5 — `.sdd/schemas/micro-unit.sdd` (channel, parent_agent, child_agents, folder, [MS9]-[MS11])
  [x] T6 — `.sdd/agent/supervisor.sdd` (ChannelRouting, ReconcileGate, CleanupVerification, [SUP-06]-[SUP-08])
  [x] T7 — `.sdd/commands/sdd-swarm.sdd` (RECONCILE step, initial load, rule refs, [SWARM-08])
  [x] T8 — INDEX updates (workflow, agent, root)
  [x] T9 — `.gitignore` — `.specdd/` runtime state (see Blockers for the remaining roots)
  [x] T10 — `pyramid-orchestration.test.ts` + Docker validation (32/32 test files pass)
  [x] T11 — DEC-2026-1011-002 + this WORK-PLAN entry

Validation:
  - Docker: `docker compose build sdd-sandbox` + compile-first test flow
    (ts-node is broken under TS7) → 32/32 test files pass, 0 failures;
    `pyramid-orchestration` 71 assertions pass.
  - `git check-ignore -v .specdd/` → `.gitignore:95:.specdd/`
  - `/sdd-health`: command sync 0 drift, retired-name 0 hits; one
    pre-existing CRITICAL mojibake in the untracked `.sdd/codding/`
    build-artifact copy (predates this phase).

Blockers:
  - Human commit required: host `git add`/`commit` are permission-denied
    for agents.
  - DEC-2026-1011-002 gate is `human_required` — Approval still PENDING.
  - `.sdd/codding/`, `sdd/projects/sddra/history/`, `docs/assets/` are
    still untracked; only `.specdd/` was ignored (plan scope T9).

## Progress Summary

Focus: Phase 130-135 - Living Engineering System

Completed:
  - Phase 130: Temporal Knowledge System (timeline/) — complete with changes/snapshots/migrations/evolution + subdirectory indexes
  - Phase 131: Task Graph & Execution Planner (tasks/ extensions) — TASK-STATE-MACHINE, LOOP-PROTECTION, SKILL-CHAIN
  - Phase 132: Multi-Agent Coordination (agent/) — core roles, specialty roles, ECC bridge, supervisor, security-rules, prompts
  - Phase 133: Semantic Engineering Graph (graph/ extensions) — model, relationships, traversal, health
  - Phase 134: Self-Evolving SDD (policies/, evolution/) — evolution pipeline, candidates/challenges/proposals/approved
  - Phase 135: SDD Query Language (queries/) — INDEX.sdd with 18 keywords, relationship syntax, 5 saved queries
  - Phase 136: Intent → Plan → Execution Graph (intents/, plans/, assumptions/) — intent lifecycle, execution modes, approval gates, assumption registry with risk levels
  - Phase 137: AI Bootstrap Protocol (bootstrap/, glossary/, system/) — 13-phase protocol, authority model, identity, handoff, glossary, context compiler, tool governance
  - Phase 138: AI Gatekeeper & Tool Governance (governance/) — 20 capabilities, permission matrix, environment policies, 15 resources with data tiers, lock protocol, trust hierarchy, security events, action journal
  - Phase 139: SDD Lifecycle & Garbage Collection (lifecycle/) — state machine (Active→Stale→Deprecated→Archived), 6 quality dimensions, garbage collector protocol, compactor, trust-aware pruning
  - ECC Framework: 67 agents → 8 core + 4 specialty roles, 281 skills, 94 commands, 35 MCP servers, 102 AgentShield rules
  - Human-readable docs: sdd-overview.md (17 commands), sdd-commands.md, ecc-integration-guide.md, deep-analysis.md
  - Unit tests: 33/33 pass, crossref tests: 3/3 pass

Current Task:
  - None — all Phase 130-137 integration work complete

Blockers:
  - None

